constModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Box constructors for primitive values.
    Provides: sir_const_i64(v) -> out Boxes a raw i64.
    Provides: sir_const_bool(v) -> out Boxes nonzero as Boolean.
    Provides: sir_const_null() -> out The Null singleton.
    Provides: sir_const_err(s) -> out Boxes an Error.
    Provides: sir_const_f64(bits) -> out Boxes an f64 payload.
